            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4.2(b) It is expected that occasional disagreement over Performance Evaluation content will be resolved at the lowest possible level. A skip-level manager may be involved in the process for this purpose. However, in those few instances where such resolution is not possible, the Union may involve the Major Organization Human Resource Director (or designee).",
