            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4.2(c) Performance Evaluation sessions (define, interim and final reviews) shall be scheduled to maximize their utility in selective salary and retention index decisions. Recommended schedule is: Define sessions: January - February; Interim sessions: June - July; Final review: December - January.",
