        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 4.5 New Employee Progress and Performance. In an effort to assist new-hire employees in reaching their full potential, the New Employee Progress Review (NEPR) will be adopted to counsel new employees to encourage and stimulate job progress and growth. The NEPR can also be used to identify and constructively address performance deficiencies in a timely manner. The program includes:",
